# Plans

One file per plan, numbered in one sequence (`NNN-short-name.md`), written from
[_TEMPLATE.md](_TEMPLATE.md). A plan is written and approved before the code; building it happens in
a separate session. Finished plans (done, rolled back or superseded) move to `finished/`.

